00137:           "content": "  def effectiveWeather\n    ret = @battle.pbWeather\n    ret = :None if [:Sun, :Rain, :HarshSun, :HeavyRain].include?(ret) && hasActiveItem?(:UTILITYUMBRELLA)\n    return ret\n  end\n",
